Subject: Enables five register homes by default

What this does
  Enables five register homes by default.

Why we need it
  Shipping builds have no `REGVM_HOMES` knob, so the home allocation was silently disabled.

What it adds
  Defaults to mode 5 when the knob is absent; knob builds still accept `REGVM_HOMES=0` for bisection.

Needs a bytecode version bump
  No.
--- a/quickjs.c
+++ b/quickjs.c
@@ -51014,7 +51014,7 @@ static __exception int compute_stack_size(JSContext *ctx,
 static int regvm_homes_mode(void)
 {
     const char *mode = REGVM_KNOB("REGVM_HOMES");
-    return mode ? atoi(mode) : 0;
+    return mode ? atoi(mode) : 5;
 }
 
